{
  "changelog": "Initial release of CAD Viewer skill, a new tool for returning live CAD review links.\n\n- Launches or reuses a local CAD Viewer process for supported 2D/3D artifact files (.step, .stp, .implicit.js, .glb, .stl, .dxf, .gcode, .urdf, .srdf, .sdf, etc.).\n- Automatically manages port selection and activation; returns direct model review links based on user file input.\n- Handles directory scoping and ensures the requested artifact exists before returning links.\n- Supports integration with Claude Preview via machine-readable JSON output.\n- Includes references for development, feature support, and optional robotics planning integrations.",
